From 5887fe9aa09b1342ac4e4e110b5250c21aefa351 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:44:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] NOC 2021 v1.0 catalog, occupation gate and keyword
 retrieval; soft-deleted tasks hidden; desk assistant button stacking
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Migration 0035: noc_snapshots/nodes/elements/crosswalk/policies + FTS5 index, immutable rows, one active snapshot
- Staged chunked import with per-chunk digests and a hash chain; activation verifies counts, parentage, bilingual parity
- Catalog lookup, unit text with duty lead-ins marked, bm25 retrieval (display rank only), occupational gate from policy
- Evaluation cards and the audit agent (12 tools) use the published reference instead of «غير متحقق»
- Soft-deleted tasks excluded from case, workflow, analytics and report readers
- Floating assistant below sidebar/backdrop; toast offset; measured overlap assertion in E2E
- Rollback script for 0034+0035 drilled on a production copy; restore drill skips FTS shadow tables
- reference/noc-2021-v1.0: package data (gzip), manifest, policy, schemas, tools

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RQZ57XDCVxFYqkyqLENrNp
